      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "it was never a false positive EAC was not designed to work in a vm, they just used shoddy detection of just checking smbios information which most people set to their real values. It works now by tricking EAC into thinking it's not a VM by disabling all hw accel with the hypervisor extension disabled.",
